68	// --- the probes ------------------------------------------------------------
69	// Each takes an injected `io` ({ exists, read, dirs, resolves }) so the whole
70	// set runs against an in-memory tree in tests. No probe imports another's
71	// result: a broken mount must not cascade into eight confusing failures, so
72	// each says one true thing about the repo in front of it.
